#! program build/docs-examples/bin/cb_color_picker
#! frames  150
#! poster  140
# drag in the saturation-value square towards the top right, pick a blue hue on the bar, then switch to the hue wheel
# and click its ring down to the left: green
0   move 60 90 10
15  down
17  move 200 80 15
35  up
45  move 242 190 10
57  down
59  up
70  move 28 49 10
82  down
84  up
100 move 85 252 12
115 down
117 up
